# ProofWeave needs NO real credentials.  Every fact in the shipped snapshot
# comes from public SEC EDGAR filings and official company newsrooms, and no
# crawler ships with this repository.
#
# This file is a template: copy it to `.env` only if you want the overrides
# below.  Never commit real keys.

# Point the CLI and API at a snapshot other than the bundled one.  Useful when
# reviewing a refreshed snapshot before it replaces the committed file.
# PROOFWEAVE_SNAPSHOT=proofweave/data/snapshot_2026_09_29.json

# Reserved for a future, optional re-crawling script.  SEC EDGAR asks that
# automated clients identify themselves with a contact address; this project
# does not currently ship such a script, so nothing reads this value yet.
# SEC_USER_AGENT="Your Name you@example.com"
